# AGENTS.md

- Project uses Next.js 16.3 (App Router)
- Prefer official docs for this version
- Use Server Components by default
- `params`, `searchParams`, `cookies()`, `headers()` must be awaited
- Package manager: npm
- For agent work rules, follow [`.cursor/rules/agent-work-preferences.mdc`](agent-work-preferences.mdc).
- For user project preferences, follow [`.cursor/rules/preferences.mdc`](preferences.mdc).
- For naming conventions (files, folders, exports, interfaces), follow [`.cursor/rules/naming-convention-preferences.mdc`](naming-convention-preferences.mdc).
- For code comments, follow [`.cursor/rules/comments.mdc`](comments.mdc).
- For unit/component test conventions, follow [`.cursor/rules/unit-tests.mdc`](unit-tests.mdc). Create / update / change / delete tests: [`.cursor/commands/update-unit-tests.mdc`](../commands/update-unit-tests.mdc).
- For subagent routing, follow [`.cursor/rules/agents.mdc`](agents.mdc).
